":6,"toolId":"swab","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-swab-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-5-equipment-pleural-site-probe-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-4"},{"title":"Represent local anaesthesia","instruction":"Place the anaesthetic syringe at the skin target. The case supplies the checked prescription.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-site","action":6,"toolId":"anaesthetic","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-anaesthetic-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-swab-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-5"},{"title":"Confirm pleural access","instruction":"Guide the aspiration needle to the pleural-space endpoint. Air appears in the syringe before the wire step opens.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":5,"toolId":"needle","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-5-equipment-pleural-end-needle-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-anaesthetic-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-6"},{"title":"Advance the guidewire","instruction":"Move the wire through each marker into the air space. Preserve the lung beyond the endpoint.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":7,"toolId":"guidewire","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-guidewire-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-5-equipment-pleural-end-needle-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-7"},{"title":"Make the skin opening","instruction":"Move the scalpel along the short skin line beside the retained wire.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-incision","action":7,"toolId":"scalpel","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-incision-scalpel-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-guidewire-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-8"},{"title":"Open the drain tract","instruction":"Advance the short dilator along the wire route. Stop at the endpoint; do not push toward the lung.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":7,"toolId":"dilator","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-dilator-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-incision-scalpel-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-9"},{"title":"Place the drain over the wire","instruction":"Follow the same route with the drain. The training model then withdraws the wire and retains the drain.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-end","action":7,"toolId":"drain","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-drain-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-dilator-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-10"},{"title":"Connect the water seal","instruction":"Fit the connector into the drain-bottle port. Keep the bottle below the chest.","targetId":"equipment:drain-circuit","action":4,"toolId":"connector","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-4-equipment-drain-circuit-connector-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-end-drain-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-11"},{"title":"Fix the holding suture","instruction":"Follow the fixation loop around the drain with the needle holder. The holding suture secures the tube.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-fixation","action":7,"toolId":"suture","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-fixation-suture-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-4-equipment-drain-circuit-connector-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-12"},{"title":"Secure the drain","instruction":"Place the fixation dressing over the entry site. Confirm the tube is secured.","targetId":"equipment:pleural-site","action":6,"toolId":"dressing","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-dressing-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-7-equipment-pleural-fixation-suture-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-13"},{"title":"Predict the structural response","instruction":"Before reassessing the patient, place the cutaway showing the expected anatomical response in the dock. Model changes are illustrative; improvement does not prove clinical recovery.","targetId":"equipment:reason-response","action":10,"toolId":"response:improved","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"response:improved","label":"Lung re-expands","model":"pneumothorax","response":1,"rationale":"The represented treatment addresses this anatomical mechanism."},{"id":"response:unchanged","label":"Unchanged anatomy","model":"pneumothorax","response":0,"rationale":"An unchanged model does not show the intended structural response. Reassess the mechanism and treatment."},{"id":"response:other","label":"Narrowed airway","model":"asthma","response":1,"rationale":"This is a different compartment or mechanism. Match the response to the anatomy actually treated."}],"explanation":"The model shows the intended anatomical change. Clinical benefit and complications still require reassessment.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"pneumothorax-0-2-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-6-equipment-pleural-site-dressing-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-14"},{"title":"Check the response","instruction":"Touch the affected lobe with the assessment pointer. Inspect expansion and the connected drain.","targetId":"MAL_RUL","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumothorax-0-2-8-mal_rul-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumothorax-0-2-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0"],"narration":"pneumothorax-step-15"}],"protectedIds":["REC_Right_IC4_Nerve","REC_Right_IC4_Artery","FMA13295","MAL_RLL"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
INSERT INTO public.thorax_learning_definitions (id, version, definition) VALUES ('asthma-0-0', '2026.10.2', '{"id":"asthma-0-0","unitId":"asthma","version":"2026.10.2","mode":0,"difficulty":0,"ordered":true,"briefing":"An adult with airway narrowing has a prescribed metered-dose inhaler and spacer. Help the virtual patient use it. One coached step and one needed instrument are shown at a time.","debrief":"The airway opens as prescribed reliever treatment takes effect. Reassess breathing and technique; the patient still needs an asthma action plan. Fictional, fixed-indication learning scenario. Responses are illustrative and time-compressed. The model does not establish clinical competence or predict a real patient outcome.","objectives":[{"title":"Find the narrowed airway","instruction":"Select the right main bronchus. Look into the enlarged airway beside the specimen.","targetId":"FMA68418","action":3,"toolId":"","equipmentState":"","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-3-fma68418-hand-0","essential":true,"weight":1,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":[],"narration":"asthma-step-0"},{"title":"Explain the anatomical mechanism","instruction":"Inspect the specimen and three cutaways. Grip the mechanism that explains this case and release it into the patient-plan dock.","targetId":"equipment:reason-mechanism","action":10,"toolId":"mechanism:asthma","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"mechanism:asthma","label":"Narrowed airway","model":"asthma","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Airway narrowing restricts airflow; it is not a pleural collection."},{"id":"mechanism:pneumonia","label":"Inflamed air spaces","model":"pneumonia","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Inflammatory material occupies affected alveolar air spaces."},{"id":"mechanism:aortic-stenosis","label":"Restricted valve opening","model":"aortic-stenosis","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Restricted aortic cusps obstruct forward flow from the left ventricle."}],"explanation":"Airway narrowing restricts airflow; it is not a pleural collection.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"asthma-0-0-10-equipment-reason-mechanism-mechanism:asthma-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-3-fma68418-hand-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-1"},{"title":"Check the patient and plan","instruction":"Confirm the prescribed device and medicine. Touch the chart with the assessment pointer. Check identity, consent, allergies and the agreed treatment.","targetId":"equipment:chart","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-10-equipment-reason-mechanism-mechanism:asthma-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-2"},{"title":"Remove the cap","instruction":"Grip the cap and pull it away along the short arrow. Inspect the open mouthpiece.","targetId":"equipment:inhaler-cap","action":7,"toolId":"cap","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-7-equipment-inhaler-cap-cap-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-3"},{"title":"Shake the inhaler","instruction":"Grip the inhaler. Move it through the three shake markers.","targetId":"equipment:inhaler-prep","action":7,"toolId":"inhaler","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-7-equipment-inhaler-prep-inhaler-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-7-equipment-inhaler-cap-cap-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-4"},{"title":"Fit the inhaler to the spacer","instruction":"Insert the inhaler mouthpiece into the rear of the spacer.","targetId":"equipment:spacer","action":4,"toolId":"inhaler","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-4-equipment-spacer-inhaler-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-7-equipment-inhaler-prep-inhaler-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-5"},{"title":"Seal the mouthpiece","instruction":"Let the virtual patient breathe out away from the spacer, then hold the mouthpiece against the lips.","targetId":"equipment:mouthpiece","action":5,"toolId":"spacer","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-5-equipment-mouthpiece-spacer-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-4-equipment-spacer-inhaler-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-6"},{"title":"Release one puff","instruction":"Press once with the inhaler aligned at the spacer. One dose enters the chamber.","targetId":"equipment:spacer","action":6,"toolId":"inhaler","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-6-equipment-spacer-inhaler-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-5-equipment-mouthpiece-spacer-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-7"},{"title":"Guide a slow breath in","instruction":"Keep the mouthpiece sealed during the green inspiration phase. The virtual patient then pauses comfortably before breathing out.","targetId":"equipment:mouthpiece","action":5,"toolId":"spacer","equipmentState":"inspiration","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-5-equipment-mouthpiece-spacer-1","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-6-equipment-spacer-inhaler-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-8"},{"title":"Predict the structural response","instruction":"Before reassessing the patient, place the cutaway showing the expected anatomical response in the dock. Model changes are illustrative; improvement does not prove clinical recovery.","targetId":"equipment:reason-response","action":10,"toolId":"response:improved","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"response:improved","label":"Airway widens","model":"asthma","response":1,"rationale":"The represented treatment addresses this anatomical mechanism."},{"id":"response:unchanged","label":"Unchanged anatomy","model":"asthma","response":0,"rationale":"An unchanged model does not show the intended structural response. Reassess the mechanism and treatment."},{"id":"response:other","label":"Narrowed coronary lumen","model":"coronary-disease","response":1,"rationale":"This is a different compartment or mechanism. Match the response to the anatomy actually treated."}],"explanation":"The model shows the intended anatomical change. Clinical benefit and complications still require reassessment.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"asthma-0-0-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-5-equipment-mouthpiece-spacer-1"],"narration":"asthma-step-9"},{"title":"Check breathing and technique","instruction":"Touch the bronchus with the assessment pointer. Compare the airway opening and review the action plan.","targetId":"FMA68418","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"asthma-0-0-8-fma68418-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["asthma-0-0-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0"],"narration":"asthma-step-10"}],"protectedIds":["FMA7131"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
