plete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-5-equipment-coronary-lesion-balloon-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-7-equipment-coronary-lesion-guidewire-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-7"},{"title":"Dilate the selected lesion","instruction":"Activate the balloon. Watch it expand, then deflate before advancing.","targetId":"equipment:coronary-lesion","action":6,"toolId":"balloon","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-coronary-lesion-balloon-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-5-equipment-coronary-lesion-balloon-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-8"},{"title":"Deploy the stent","instruction":"Position the stent at the same lesion and activate. The scaffold remains in the artery.","targetId":"equipment:coronary-lesion","action":6,"toolId":"stent","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-coronary-lesion-stent-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-coronary-lesion-balloon-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-9"},{"title":"Withdraw the delivery device","instruction":"Move the catheter back along the withdrawal markers. The stent stays in place.","targetId":"equipment:catheter-withdrawal","action":7,"toolId":"balloon","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-7-equipment-catheter-withdrawal-balloon-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0.95,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-coronary-lesion-stent-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-10"},{"title":"Close the access site","instruction":"Fit the compression band around the radial access model.","targetId":"equipment:radial-access","action":6,"toolId":"dressing","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-radial-access-dressing-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-7-equipment-catheter-withdrawal-balloon-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-11"},{"title":"Predict the structural response","instruction":"Before reassessing the patient, place the cutaway showing the expected anatomical response in the dock. Model changes are illustrative; improvement does not prove clinical recovery.","targetId":"equipment:reason-response","action":10,"toolId":"response:improved","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"response:improved","label":"Wider treated lumen","model":"coronary-disease","response":1,"rationale":"The represented treatment addresses this anatomical mechanism."},{"id":"response:unchanged","label":"Unchanged anatomy","model":"coronary-disease","response":0,"rationale":"An unchanged model does not show the intended structural response. Reassess the mechanism and treatment."},{"id":"response:other","label":"Pleural air","model":"pneumothorax","response":1,"rationale":"This is a different compartment or mechanism. Match the response to the anatomy actually treated."}],"explanation":"The model shows the intended anatomical change. Clinical benefit and complications still require reassessment.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"coronary-disease-0-2-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-6-equipment-radial-access-dressing-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-12"},{"title":"Review final flow","instruction":"Probe the left coronary artery. Compare the lumen and review the follow-up plan.","targetId":"FMA50040","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"coronary-disease-0-2-8-fma50040-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.03,"maxAngle":22,"minContactSeconds":1.2,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["coronary-disease-0-2-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0"],"narration":"coronary-disease-step-13"}],"protectedIds":["FMA7252","FMA7253","FMA7254"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
INSERT INTO public.thorax_learning_definitions (id, version, definition) VALUES ('pneumonia-0-0', '2026.10.2', '{"id":"pneumonia-0-0","unitId":"pneumonia","version":"2026.10.2","mode":0,"difficulty":0,"ordered":true,"briefing":"An adult has confirmed bacterial pneumonia, prescribed antibiotics and an oxygen order for hypoxaemia. One coached step and one needed instrument are shown at a time.","debrief":"Review response and microbiology. Review intravenous treatment by 48 hours. Fever often settles before cough and fatigue; persistent or worsening symptoms need reassessment. Fictional, fixed-indication learning scenario. Responses are illustrative and time-compressed. The model does not establish clinical competence or predict a real patient outcome.","objectives":[{"title":"Find the affected lobe","instruction":"Select the right inferior lobe. Compare air spaces with the clear neighboring tissue.","targetId":"MAL_RLL","action":3,"toolId":"","equipmentState":"","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-3-mal_rll-hand-0","essential":true,"weight":1,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":[],"narration":"pneumonia-step-0"},{"title":"Explain the anatomical mechanism","instruction":"Inspect the specimen and three cutaways. Grip the mechanism that explains this case and release it into the patient-plan dock.","targetId":"equipment:reason-mechanism","action":10,"toolId":"mechanism:pneumonia","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"mechanism:pneumonia","label":"Inflamed air spaces","model":"pneumonia","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Inflammatory material occupies affected alveolar air spaces."},{"id":"mechanism:coronary-disease","label":"Narrowed coronary lumen","model":"coronary-disease","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Coronary plaque limits the vessel lumen and myocardial blood supply."},{"id":"mechanism:pneumothorax","label":"Pleural air","model":"pneumothorax","response":0,"rationale":"Compare this cutaway with the observed anatomy. Air in the pleural space separates the lung from the chest wall."}],"explanation":"Inflammatory material occupies affected alveolar air spaces.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"pneumonia-0-0-10-equipment-reason-mechanism-mechanism:pneumonia-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-3-mal_rll-hand-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-1"},{"title":"Check the patient and plan","instruction":"Review severity, allergies and the written antibiotic and oxygen orders. Touch the chart with the assessment pointer. Check identity, consent, allergies and the agreed treatment.","targetId":"equipment:chart","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-10-equipment-reason-mechanism-mechanism:pneumonia-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-2"},{"title":"Record a respiratory baseline","instruction":"Place the monitoring probe on the virtual patient''s finger. Review the qualitative breathing and oxygenation indicators.","targetId":"equipment:monitor","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-chart-probe-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-3"},{"title":"Check the medication order","instruction":"Touch the prescription dock with the labeled medicine. Match patient, medicine, route and the supplied order.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":5,"toolId":"medication","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-4"},{"title":"Prepare the prescribed route","instruction":"Join the prepared administration set to its labeled port.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":4,"toolId":"connector","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-4-equipment-prescribed-care-connector-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-5"},{"title":"Administer the ordered treatment","instruction":"Seat the checked medicine in its administration port. Hold the trigger to represent the prescribed administration.","targetId":"equipment:prescribed-care","action":6,"toolId":"medication","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-6-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-4-equipment-prescribed-care-connector-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-6"},{"title":"Apply the oxygen order","instruction":"Fit the support mask to the virtual patient. The case uses its supplied oxygen order.","targetId":"equipment:mouthpiece","action":6,"toolId":"oxygen","equipmentState":"connected","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-6-equipment-mouthpiece-oxygen-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-6-equipment-prescribed-care-medication-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-7"},{"title":"Recheck respiratory support","instruction":"Return the monitoring probe to the finger. Compare the response with baseline.","targetId":"equipment:monitor","action":5,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-1","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-6-equipment-mouthpiece-oxygen-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-8"},{"title":"Predict the structural response","instruction":"Before reassessing the patient, place the cutaway showing the expected anatomical response in the dock. Model changes are illustrative; improvement does not prove clinical recovery.","targetId":"equipment:reason-response","action":10,"toolId":"response:improved","equipmentState":"placed","choices":[{"id":"response:improved","label":"Gradual clearing","model":"pneumonia","response":1,"rationale":"The represented treatment addresses this anatomical mechanism."},{"id":"response:unchanged","label":"Unchanged anatomy","model":"pneumonia","response":0,"rationale":"An unchanged model does not show the intended structural response. Reassess the mechanism and treatment."},{"id":"response:other","label":"Restricted valve opening","model":"aortic-stenosis","response":1,"rationale":"This is a different compartment or mechanism. Match the response to the anatomy actually treated."}],"explanation":"Inflammatory air-space changes improve over time; oxygen support alone does not eliminate infection.","criticalOnWrong":false,"id":"pneumonia-0-0-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.09,"maxAngle":180,"minContactSeconds":0,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-5-equipment-monitor-probe-1"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-9"},{"title":"Review the follow-up timeline","instruction":"Probe the affected lobe. Watch the days-and-weeks timeline; recovery is gradual.","targetId":"MAL_RLL","action":8,"toolId":"probe","equipmentState":"ready","explanation":"Step complete. Follow the next single instruction.","id":"pneumonia-0-0-8-mal_rll-probe-0","essential":true,"weight":2,"maxDistance":0.075,"maxAngle":55,"minContactSeconds":0.6,"minPathFraction":0,"prerequisites":["pneumonia-0-0-10-equipment-reason-response-response:improved-0"],"narration":"pneumonia-step-10"}],"protectedIds":["REC_Right_Phrenic_nerve"]}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id,version) DO UPDATE SET definition=excluded.definition;
